OL,3,GNEWSACouple's 'surreal' night hosting
OL,4,Afilm premiere party
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple have described as "surreal"
OL,7,Ffinding themselves hosting a
OL,8,Flast-minute after-party for the
OL,9,Fpremiere of a new film.
OL,11,FHannah Walters, who is married to
OL,12,FKirkby-born actor Stephen Graham, was
OL,13,Fcelebrating her first lead role in a
OL,14,Fnew independent film Amazing Grace
OL,15,Fwhich had its first showing at the
OL,16,FPlaza Community Cinema in Waterloo,
OL,17,FMerseyside.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
