OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouple's 'surreal' night hosting
OL,4,Afilm premiere party
OL,5,
OL,6,FJay Wilson and Eve Smith - owners of
OL,7,Fthe nearby Il Capitano restaurant -
OL,8,Fsaid they were called by the cinema and
OL,9,Fasked if they could host the
OL,10,Fafter-party for the film set in
OL,11,FLiverpool.
OL,13,F"It was a whirlwind," Wilson said,
OL,14,Fwhile Smith added that "everyone was so
OL,15,Fdown to earth".
